Error [jet.UnknownFunction]: `Int` has no static method `price`
  --> tests/ui/generics/generic_module_missing_static_function_reports_at_instance.jet:5:1
    |
  5 | int_billing: billing<Int>
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  --> tests/ui/generics/generic_module_missing_static_function_reports_at_instance.jet:3:35
    |
  3 |     total: fn(item: R) -> Int { R.price(item) }
    |                                   ^^^^^ in the template body this instance expands
 Why: Built-in types expose only their documented static methods
 Fix: Call a documented static method on `Int`, or call `.price()` on a value that provides it
